e1: url -> nav-request produces note="The address bar hands the browser one URL."
e2: hsts -> url shapes note="The list upgrades http to https before anything leaves the machine."
e3: nav-request -> http-cache checks note="Ask for a stored copy before touching the network."
e4: http-cache -> html-bytes serves note="A fresh copy ends the request here. Everything below is skipped."
e5: nav-request -> dns-query produces note="No fresh copy, so the browser has to find the server."
e6: dns-cache -> dns-query shapes note="A recent answer skips the round trip."
e7: dns-query -> ip-address produces note="The resolver answers with an address."
e8: ip-address -> tcp-handshake enables note="One round trip opens a reliable connection."
e9: tcp-handshake -> tls-handshake enables note="A second exchange agrees on keys and checks the certificate."
e10: tls-handshake -> secure-channel produces note="The channel is now private and verified."
e11: secure-channel -> http-request carries note="The request for the document goes out."
e12: cookie-jar -> http-request shapes note="Matching cookies ride along."
e13: http-request -> http-response produces note="The server replies with a status, headers, and a body."
e14: http-response -> html-bytes carries note="The body streams in pieces."
e15: cache-policy -> http-cache shapes note="Response headers decide how long the copy stays fresh."
e16: http-response -> http-cache fills note="The browser stores the copy for next time. This happens beside the render, not before it."
e17: html-bytes -> token-stream produces note="The parser reads bytes as they arrive."
e18: token-stream -> dom-tree becomes note="Tokens nest into a tree of nodes."
e19: token-stream -> preload-scanner enables note="A second reader races ahead of the parser."
e20: preload-scanner -> subresource-request produces note="Files are fetched before the parser reaches them."
e21: subresource-request -> css-bytes produces note="The stylesheet arrives."
e22: subresource-request -> js-bytes produces note="The script arrives."
e23: css-bytes -> cssom-tree becomes note="Rules nest into a tree the browser can match."
e24: js-bytes -> script-execution enables note="The script is ready to run."
e25: script-execution -> dom-tree shapes note="A script can add, move, or remove nodes."
e26: cssom-tree -> script-execution blocks note="A pending stylesheet holds back a script that may read styles."
e27: dom-tree -> render-tree produces note="Only the nodes that will be drawn."
e28: cssom-tree -> render-tree produces note="Each drawn node carries its computed style."
e29: render-tree -> layout-boxes produces note="Every node gets a size and a position."
e30: layout-boxes -> paint-records produces note="Boxes become ordered drawing instructions."
e31: paint-records -> composited-frame becomes note="Layers combine into one image."
e32: composited-frame -> first-paint produces note="The person finally sees content."
